#: admin/class-bp-activity-filter-admin-setting.php:54
msgid "BP Activity Filter Settings"
msgstr "Paramètres Filtrage des Activités"

#: admin/class-bp-activity-filter-admin-setting.php:80
msgid "Email Support"
msgstr "Envoyer un courriel au soutien technique"

#: admin/class-bp-activity-filter-admin-setting.php:82
msgid "User Manual"
msgstr "Manuel d’Instructions"

#: admin/class-bp-activity-filter-admin-setting.php:84
msgid "Rate Us on WordPress.org"
msgstr "Évaluez-nous sur WordPress.org"

#: admin/class-bp-activity-filter-admin-setting.php:90
msgid "BuddyPress Activity Filter Settings"
msgstr "Paramètres Filtrage des Activités"

#: admin/class-bp-activity-filter-admin-setting.php:94
msgid "Settings saved."
msgstr "Paramètres sauvegardés."

#: admin/class-bp-activity-filter-admin-setting.php:98
msgid "Dismiss this notice."
msgstr "Ignorer cette notice."

#: admin/class-bp-activity-filter-admin-setting.php:280
msgid "Display Activity"
msgstr "Afficher l’activité"

#: admin/class-bp-activity-filter-admin-setting.php:282
msgid "Hide Activity"
msgstr "Masquer l'activité"

#: admin/class-bp-activity-filter-admin-setting.php:284
msgid "Post Type Activity"
msgstr "Type de Post d’Activité"

#: admin/class-bp-activity-filter-admin-setting.php:286
msgid "FAQ"
msgstr "FAQ"

#: admin/class-bp-activity-filter-admin-setting.php:408
msgid "Select activity you want to list on activity page by default."
msgstr ""
"Sélectionner l’activité que vous voulez lister par défaut sur le fil "
"d’activité."

#: admin/class-bp-activity-filter-admin-setting.php:420
#: admin/class-bp-activity-filter-admin-setting.php:525
msgid "Everything"
msgstr "Tout"

#: admin/class-bp-activity-filter-admin-setting.php:463
#: admin/class-bp-activity-filter-admin-setting.php:571
#: admin/class-bp-activity-filter-admin-setting.php:855
msgid "Save Settings"
msgstr "Sauvegarder les paramètres"

#: admin/class-bp-activity-filter-admin-setting.php:513
msgid ""
"Select activity filters those you want to hide from the dropdown list on "
"activity front page."
msgstr ""
"Sélectionnez les titres d’activité que vous voulez cacher du menu déroulant "
"en page principale."

#: admin/class-bp-activity-filter-admin-setting.php:595
msgid "Is this plugin requires another plugin?"
msgstr "Ce plugin nécessite-t-il un autre plugin?"

#: admin/class-bp-activity-filter-admin-setting.php:601
msgid "Yes, this plugin requires BuddyPress plugin."
msgstr "Oui, ce plugin nécessite le plugin BuddyPress."

#: admin/class-bp-activity-filter-admin-setting.php:607
msgid "By default, which filters will be displayed in activity dropdown?"
msgstr ""
"Par défaut, quels filtres vont être affichés dans le menu déroulant des "
"activités?"

#: admin/class-bp-activity-filter-admin-setting.php:613
msgid "By default, all filters will be displayed."
msgstr "Par défaut, tous les titres sont affichés."

#: admin/class-bp-activity-filter-admin-setting.php:619
msgid "By default, which filters will be hidden in activity dropdown?"
msgstr "Par défaut, quels filtres seront cachés du menu déroulant d’activités?"

#: admin/class-bp-activity-filter-admin-setting.php:625
msgid "By default, no filter will be hidden."
msgstr "Par défaut, aucun titre n’est caché."

#: admin/class-bp-activity-filter-admin-setting.php:631
msgid "If I selected 'Display in Groups' then what will be happened?"
msgstr ""
"Si je sélectionne 'Afficher dans les Groupes' qu’est-ce qui va arriver?"

#: admin/class-bp-activity-filter-admin-setting.php:637
msgid ""
"If you selected 'Display in Groups' option then when you add a new post in "
"that specific custom post type, all BuddyPress groups display this activity."
msgstr ""
"Si vous sélectionnez 'Afficher dans les Groupes', lorsque vous créerez un "
"message de ce type, il s'affichera dans tous les groupes auxquels vous être "
"abonné."

#: admin/class-bp-activity-filter-admin-setting.php:643
msgid "What will be displayed if 'Rename in Activity Stream' field empty?"
msgstr ""
"Que va-t-il s'afficher si la case \"Renommer dans le fil d'activité\" est "
"laissé vide?"

#: admin/class-bp-activity-filter-admin-setting.php:649
msgid ""
"If this field is empty then the singular label of custom post type will be "
"displayed."
msgstr ""
"Si la case est laissée vide, l'étiquette normale de ce type de post sera "
"utilisé et affiché."

#: admin/class-bp-activity-filter-admin-setting.php:655
msgid ""
"How to modify the custom post type activity content display on the front end?"
msgstr ""
"Comment modifier le contenu d'activité de ce certains types de posts sur le "
"l’interface usager?"

#: admin/class-bp-activity-filter-admin-setting.php:661
msgid "You can modify activity content by given filters."
msgstr "Vous pouvez modifier le contenu de l'activité par des filtres donnés."

#: admin/class-bp-activity-filter-admin-setting.php:677
msgid "Where do I ask for support?"
msgstr "Où puis-je demander de l'aide?"

#: admin/class-bp-activity-filter-admin-setting.php:683
msgid ""
"Please visit <a href=\"http://wbcomdesigns.com/contact\" rel=\"nofollow\" "
"target=\"_blank\">Wbcom Designs</a> for any query related to plugin and "
"BuddyPress."
msgstr ""
"S'il vous plaît visitez <a href=\"http://wbcomdesigns.com/contact\" rel="
"\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Wbcom Designs</a> pour toute requête liée au "
"plugin et BuddyPress."

#: admin/class-bp-activity-filter-admin-setting.php:785
msgid "Rename in Activity Stream"
msgstr "Renomer dans le fil d’activité"

#: admin/class-bp-activity-filter-admin-setting.php:809
msgid "Do not display"
msgstr "Ne pas afficher"

#: admin/class-bp-activity-filter-admin-setting.php:821
msgid "Display in main Activity Stream"
msgstr "Afficher dans le fil d’activité principal"

#: admin/class-bp-activity-filter-admin-setting.php:835
msgid "Display in Groups"
msgstr "Afficher dans les Groupes"

#: buddypress-activity-filter.php:35
msgid ""
"The <b>BuddyPress Activity Filter</b> plugin requires <b>BuddyPress</b> "
"plugin to be installed and active. For now, the plugin will be deactivated."
msgstr ""
"Le plugin <b>Filtrage des Activités</b> nécessite <b>BuddyPress</b> pour "
"être installé et actif. Pour l'instant, le plugin sera désactivé."

#: buddypress-activity-filter.php:144
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Paramètres"

#: buddypress-activity-filter.php:193 buddypress-activity-filter.php:217
msgid ""
"BuddyPress Activity Filter requires to be activated on the blog where "
"BuddyPress is activated."
msgstr ""
"Filtrage des Activités nécessite d'être activé sur le blog où BuddyPress est "
"activé."

#: buddypress-activity-filter.php:198 buddypress-activity-filter.php:223
msgid ""
"BuddyPress Activity Filter and BuddyPress need to share the same network "
"configuration."
msgstr ""
"Filtrage des Activités et BuddyPress doivent partager la même configuration "
"réseau."

#. Plugin Name of the plugin/theme
msgid "BuddyPress Activity Filter"
msgstr "BuddyPress Filtrage des Activités"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin/theme
msgid "https://wbcomdesigns.com/downloads/buddypress-activity-filter/"
msgstr "https://wbcomdesigns.com/downloads/buddypress-activity-filter/"

#. Description of the plugin/theme
msgid ""
"This plugin will extend Buddypress for the admin to set default and "
"customized activities to be listed on front-end"
msgstr ""
"Ce plugin va étendre BuddyPress pour l'administrateur de définir les "
"activités par défaut et personnalisés pour être répertoriés sur le fil "
"d'activité"

#. Author of the plugin/theme
msgid "Wbcom Designs<admin@wbcomdesigns.com>"
msgstr "Wbcom Designs<admin@wbcomdesigns.com>"

#. Author URI of the plugin/theme
msgid "https://www.wbcomdesigns.com/"
msgstr "https://www.wbcomdesigns.com/"
